WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.737
-I want to talk to you about
the Steelers very briefly.

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:05.705
-I mean, already?
That´s all you care about, huh?

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It is. It is.
It´s on my mind.

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It´s like --
what´s wrong with you guys?

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:10.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, your guy,
Joe Manganiello,

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.545 size:84% position:42%
who is a lovely person,

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:14.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
and not just because
he is a big Steelers fan.

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:16.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you have sort of
married into that world.

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:17.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:19.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you are
such a beautiful woman,

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.354
and I believe that if anyone,

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:24.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
if anyone could make
Steelers gear look sexy,

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:25.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
it would be you.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:28.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I saw this photo
and realized that I was wrong.

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:31.698 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:33.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
You´re not --

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:35.168 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:36.503
I have to be honest with you.

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:37.971
You always look very happy.

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:40.206
You do not seem to have any joy
in your eyes in this photo.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, it´s like --
The only, like --

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would say
that it´s, like, the --

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:48.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
Only bad thing, like,
that Joe has

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:51.584 align:start size:94% position:6%
is, like, he doesn´t --
It´s like a defect, I think.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:53.520
It´s like he doesn´t understand

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:57.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
that Steeler clothes is not,
like, a brand, you know?

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.159 size:75% position:38%
-Yeah. I see, right.

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:01.528
-It´s like he thinks that that´s
the only thing that is clothes.

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:04.697 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, if he doesn´t have
a T-shirt or a shirt

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:07.700 size:81% position:41%
or a jacket or socks
that say "Steelers" --

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.370
It´s like he doesn´t understand
that that is not clothes.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:13.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
That´s like --
like a thing for games,

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
to wear to when you go
to the stadium.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.845
-Yes. Doesn´t understand.
-He doesn´t understand.

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:21.748
-In a perfect world, he would be
on the red carpet at the Oscars,

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:22.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they´d say,
"Who are you wearing?"

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:24.584
And he´d say, "The Steelers."

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:26.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, and -- and me too.
And me too.

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s like --

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:30.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
He, like, sometimes
will lay out things just like,

00:01:30.523 --> 00:01:31.858
"Look how beautiful that is."

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:34.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s like --
I´m like, "Yeah, beautiful."

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:37.464
-And I will say, my wife has
made the observation, as well,

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:40.433
that black and gold
are not good colors for a lady.

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:42.502
It is just --
-I mean, that doesn´t really --

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:44.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean,
that´s not the worst part.

00:01:44.838 --> 00:01:48.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
That makes you look like
a bumblebee, but --

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:49.943
The worst part is like --

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:53.079 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s not every day,
for God´s sake, you know?

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:56.549
It´s like every once in a while.
It´s, like, you know.

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:58.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
I could have worse problems
than that.

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:00.286
-You could have worse problems.

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:01.921 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, I want to bring up
something that might,

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:03.623
to me, maybe is a worse problem.

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:06.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because Joe looks like someone
who would be a sports fan.

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
He looks like an athlete.
-Yes, he is.

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:12.732
-But I did not realize this
until today, that he is still --

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:14.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
still plays
Dungeons &amp; Dragons.

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:16.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
That can´t be true.

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:19.205 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ] Yes.
-He does?!

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:21.207 size:84% position:42%
-Yeah, and he´s like --
He´s obsessed with it.

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:24.978
-Wow.
-He has like a lot of figurines.

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:27.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
He has, like,
a dungeon in the house,

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:29.549 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he has like
a lot of figurines.

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:31.518
-Like a fake dungeon, right?

00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:32.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:35.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, it was like
a wine cellar and --

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:37.257 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was supposed to
be the "wine cellar,"

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:40.393
and suddenly with, like, the
months, it started to happen.

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:43.196 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s like -- I wish
I had brought you a picture.

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:46.166
It´s like -- He has, like,
these gigantic heads of dragons

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:48.034 size:81% position:41%
