00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:52.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
It has, like, a little village
all in the table.

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:54.774
It´s not a wine cellar anymore.
It´s a dungeon.

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:57.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just, like, gigantic chairs,
and they love it,

00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:00.346
because they feel like it
gets them in the mood, I think.

00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:01.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don´t know.

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:03.449 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So he actually
has friends over,

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:05.685
and they come
and they go down to the dungeon.

00:03:05.685 --> 00:03:08.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And they stay there forever.
I just hear them.

00:03:08.555 --> 00:03:11.858
I´ve seen very pretty girls
go down there and play, too.

00:03:11.858 --> 00:03:13.760 size:84% position:42%
-Oh, wow. And that´s --

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:16.162
You´re very forward-thinking
that you would let that happen.

00:03:16.162 --> 00:03:17.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now I´m thinking --
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.633
-Now I´m thinking that this
might be all some sort of sham.

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:22.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.435 --> 00:03:26.005
"No, honey. They´re just here
for the -- for the dragons."

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:28.041
-Yeah, so, girls play it, too.

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:30.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
But he loves it,
and he invites friends.

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:31.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I love it.

00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:32.579 size:84% position:42%
I love being part of it

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:36.282 align:start size:94% position:6%
