him food there, beverages.

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:38.484
-And do you bring down, like,

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:40.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
beverages that are
appropriate to dungeons,

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:41.821
or is it just regular beverages?

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:44.958
-I have never really been,
like, in a <i>dungeon </i>dungeon,

00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:46.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I don´t really know
what´s appropriate.

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:48.228 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that´s true.

00:03:48.228 --> 00:03:50.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I feel like Columbian coffee
is always appropriate,

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I put, like, a thing there
that stays hot

00:03:53.099 --> 00:03:55.134 size:88% position:44%
