have to go up and down.

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:56.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That´s great.

00:03:56.736 --> 00:04:00.440
-And cheese, crackers, um, tea.

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:02.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This sounds like
a lovely dungeon.

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:04.510 size:81% position:41%
-Yeah, yeah. I mean --

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, if it´s ever free
for a weekend,

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:09.282
I will Airbnb that dungeon.
-I know. When you´re in L.A.

00:04:09.282 --> 00:04:10.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, please.

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:11.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
